From: Sébastien Taylor <sebastien@au-zone.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: freescale: imx95-19x19-evk: add
 os08a20-isp-adv7535 combo

NXP ships an os08a20 + NeoISP + ADV7535 combo devicetree for the
imx95-15x15-evk board (imx95-15x15-evk-os08a20-isp-adv7535.dtb) but
never added the equivalent for imx95-19x19-evk -- only os08a20
combos paired with the IT6263 bridge exist there.

The os08a20 CSI-2 link uses the SoC's dedicated Rx-only D-PHY
(CSI-2 controller #0), which is independent of the Rx/Tx combo D-PHY
shared between CSI-2 controller #1 and the DSI host, so os08a20 and
DSI-based ADV7535 output can run concurrently on this board.

Add imx95-19x19-evk-os08a20-isp-adv7535.dtb by combining the existing
imx95-19x19-evk-adv7535.dtb base with the imx95-19x19-evk-os08a20.dtbo
overlay, mirroring the 15x15 pattern.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific devicetree combination not shipped by NXP]
Signed-off-by: Sébastien Taylor <sebastien@au-zone.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile
@@ -1043,6 +1043,10 @@
 				       imx95-19x19-evk-ap1302.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx95-19x19-evk-adv7535-ap1302.dtb
 
+imx95-19x19-evk-os08a20-isp-adv7535-dtbs := imx95-19x19-evk-adv7535.dtb \
+					    imx95-19x19-evk-os08a20.dtbo
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx95-19x19-evk-os08a20-isp-adv7535.dtb
+
 imx95-19x19-evk-lt9611uxc-dtbs := imx95-19x19-evk.dtb imx95-19x19-evk-lt9611uxc.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx95-19x19-evk-lt9611uxc.dtb
 
